  "details": "With the new keyboard now inheriting colors from different UI themes, there are a bunch of glaring issues with how they're presented:\n\n- The Top bar is stuck as the bluish-purple color and does not match the set theme (it honestly doesn't even look right in the \"default\" theme)\n\n- The background color around the textbox is the exact same off-green gray tone\n\n- The X icons on the keyboard are not aligned with any other symbols in the UI so they mismatch (see image 4)",
